sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Operator
    participant UI as Admin UI
    participant P as Policy
    participant S as Sandbox
    participant SSH as Named SSH
    participant DB as Audit DB
    O->>UI: review plan
    UI->>P: validate policy and target
    P->>S: validate named operation
    S->>SSH: execute after approval
    SSH->>DB: persist result
    DB-->>UI: verification and audit
